==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*10 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for level 19 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first.

Fallen Bear is truly a threatening enemy; luckily, as his debut stage, Sahara isn't too mean. As long as you have many meatshields and you can take out Aku Gories before they stack, you should be fine.

